@startuml
title А1. СМП — системный контекст
scale max 1600*900
left to right direction
actor "POS-терминал / Terminal Simulator" as terminal
actor "Мерчант / Merchant + Acquirer Simulator" as merchant
actor "Пользователь Dashboard" as user
rectangle "СМП\nСистема обработки платежей" as smp {
  component "Gateway → Switch → Authorization\nCard Management; Transaction Logger;\nNotification Service; Dashboard и симуляторы" as core
  database "PostgreSQL" as db
  queue "RabbitMQ" as mq
}
cloud "BIN Lookup Service\nВнешний справочник BIN → issuerId" as bin
terminal --> smp : Транзакция и ответ\nHTTP REST через Gateway
merchant --> smp : Транзакция и ответ\nHTTP REST через Gateway
user --> smp : UI; REST данные; live events\nHTTP(S) / REST / WebSocket
smp --> bin : Разрешение issuerId по первым 6 цифрам PAN\nHTTP GET /api/bin/{bin}
note bottom of smp
Граница системы охватывает компоненты из docker-compose.yaml.
Источники: docs/architecture.md; services/gateway/.../GatewayRouteProperties.java;
services/switch/.../RouteService.java; services/authorization/.../BinLookupClient.java.
end note
@enduml
